      {
       "text": "Checklist. Give every item below exactly one disposition.\n- chk:ob:SF1@candidate: Every protected subject or feature named in the job requirements keeps its identity, shape, position and extent relative to the source.\n- chk:ob:SF2@candidate: The candidate is derived from the source: same scene, same camera, same projection; nothing rotated, stretched or cropped away.\n- chk:ob:RQ1@candidate: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref0: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref1: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref2: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref3: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref4: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref5: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref6: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref7: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref8: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref9: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref10: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref11: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref12: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref13: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref14: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref15: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref16: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref17: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n- chk:ref:ref18: The candidate keeps the palette and layout the reference images share.\n"
      },
